OL,5,G0325 Clodagh: Cooking at Home
OL,6,     FIrish chef and author Clodagh
OL,7,     FMcKenna demonstrates the recipes
OL,8,     Fthat she loves to cook, beginning
OL,9,     Fwith four of her favourite one-pan
OL,10,     Fdishes . She makes broccoli salmon
OL,11,     Fnoodles and an all-in-one spicy
OL,12,     Fsausage pasta, and shares the
OL,13,     Ftricks to make her pear, thyme and
OL,14,     Fbrie tart. She then picks greens
OL,15,     Ffrom the garden to go in a big
OL,16,     Fwarming pot of walled garden soup
OL,17,     Fthat she makes in her pickling
OL,18,     Fshed to share with her husband
OL,19,     FHarry Herbert
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
